  "logo": "https://cdn.uppromote.com/storage/uploads/logo/1685937501_5743467_293c467c8f6f479f57999e30a1bfdf92Lashes-2.png",
  "description": "<p class=\"p1\" style=\"text-decoration: none; box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 10px; line-height: 1.8; caret-color: rgb(25, 58, 67); color: rgb(25, 58, 67); font-family: 'Neutra Text TF'; font-size: 14px; text-align: left;\"><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; text-decoration: underline;\"><span class=\"s1\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\">🌎 <strong style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: bolder;\">IMagic MISSION - GLOBAL LASH BRAND</strong></span></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"p2\" style=\"text-decoration: none; box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 10px; line-height: 1.8; caret-color: rgb(25, 58, 67); color: rgb(25, 58, 67); font-family: 'Neutra Text TF'; font-size: 14px; text-align: left;\"><span class=\"s1\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\">We are proud to open our first USA location to San Jose, CA in&nbsp;<strong style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: bolder;\">2015<span style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\">&nbsp;</span></strong>for Eyelash Extensions. I'Magic was founded in Taiwan in<span style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\">&nbsp;</span><strong style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: bolder;\">2009</strong>, and currently has 2 locations in Asia. The Eyelash Industry in Taiwan/Asia is truly advance in skills, products, safety, and we are glad to bring the same high-quality products to you!</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"p1\" style=\"text-decoration: none; box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 10px; line-height: 1.8; caret-color: rgb(25, 58, 67); color: rgb(25, 58, 67); font-family: 'Neutra Text TF'; font-size: 14px; text-align: left;\"><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; text-decoration: underline;\"><strong style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: bolder;\"><span class=\"s1\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\">IMagic PRODUCTS</span></strong></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"p2\" style=\"text-decoration: none; box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 10px; line-height: 1.8; caret-color: rgb(25, 58, 67); color: rgb(25, 58, 67); font-family: 'Neutra Text TF'; font-size: 14px; text-align: left;\"><span class=\"s1\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\">IMagic continues to stay up to date with the latest trends and products to ensure our clients get the absolute best materials to do lashes. We never cut corners and constantly have to sample and test new products to ensure you only get top-notch quality! All products are Vegan, Animal Cruelty Free!<span class=\"Apple-converted-space\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\">&nbsp; &nbsp;</span></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"p1\" style=\"text-decoration: none; box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 10px; line-height: 1.8; caret-color: rgb(25, 58, 67); color: rgb(25, 58, 67); font-family: 'Neutra Text TF'; font-size: 14px; text-align: left;\"><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; text-decoration: underline;\"><strong style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: bolder;\"><span class=\"s1\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\">IMagic STAFF</span></strong></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"p2\" style=\"text-decoration: none; box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 10px; line-height: 1.8; caret-color: rgb(25, 58, 67); color: rgb(25, 58, 67); font-family: 'Neutra Text TF'; font-size: 14px; text-align: left;\"><span class=\"s1\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\">Jasmine and Claire and Erin Li has been lashing since 2009, and has trained over 2000+ students in Classic, Volume and Megavolume eyelash training. More info at<span style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\">&nbsp;</span><a style=\"box-sizing: border-box; color: var(--g-main); text-decoration: none; transition: all 0.3s ease-in;\" href=\"https://www.imagiclashes.com/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">www.imagiclashes.com</a></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"p2\" style=\"text-decoration: none; box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 10px; line-height: 1.8; caret-color: rgb(25, 58, 67); color: rgb(25, 58, 67); font-family: 'Neutra Text TF'; font-size: 14px; text-align: left;\"><span class=\"s1\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"><strong style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: bolder;\">Certifications:<span style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\">&nbsp;</span></strong>Eyes Beauty Lash Certified (2009), IMagic Volume/Mega Certified(2014), Lash Bible UK Volume (2015), Xtreme Lashes Classic/Volume USA)2016), Flawless Lashes Volume Certified(2015), Long Beach Lash Summit Global, Lash &amp; Brow Russian 6D volume by Irina (2014), Lashbox LA Mega Volume(2018), California Cosmetologist License, MBA degree at University of Buffalo</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"p2\" style=\"text-decoration: none; box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 10px; line-height: 1.8; caret-color: rgb(25, 58, 67); color: rgb(25, 58, 67); font-family: 'Neutra Text TF'; font-size: 14px; text-align: left;\"><span class=\"s1\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"><strong style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: bolder;\">Notable:<span style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\">&nbsp;</span></strong>1st Place Global Lash Summit 2015 Volume Competition @ Long Beach, Lash Wars 2016 Volume Finalist, Lash Judge at various competitions globally</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"p2\" style=\"text-decoration: none; box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 10px; line-height: 1.8; caret-color: rgb(25, 58, 67); color: rgb(25, 58, 67); font-family: 'Neutra Text TF'; font-size: 14px; text-align: left;\"><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; text-decoration: underline;\"><span class=\"s1\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"><strong style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: bolder;\">I&rsquo;MAgic Partners:</strong> </span></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"p2\" style=\"text-decoration: none; box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 10px; line-height: 1.8; caret-color: rgb(25, 58, 67); color: rgb(25, 58, 67); font-family: 'Neutra Text TF'; font-size: 14px; text-align: left;\"><span class=\"s1\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\">🇺🇸 #1 Glamcor Distributor in Asia, and now USA</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"p2\" style=\"text-decoration: none; box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 10px; 